        notes         "constants: NIST CCCBDB release 22 (cccbdb.nist.gov, SRD 101), fetched 2026-11-22 experimental page: rotational constants A,B,C and the nine fundamentals from Herzberg, Electronic Spectra and Electronic Structure of Polyatomic Molecules (1966) as listed there; ground state 1A1 (first excited level 25975 cm-1 neglected)";
